# Dependencies — `**/` matters: a bare `node_modules` only matches the root level,
# so a host `app/web/node_modules` was being COPYed over the image's pnpm links
# (host vinext 1.2.0 replaced the installed 1.3.1 and the build died MODULE_NOT_FOUND).
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store

# Build output
**/dist
**/.output
**/.vinext
**/.turbo

# Git
.git

# 本地运行态数据：既不进镜像，也会击穿 `COPY app/server/ ./` 那层
# （db/*.db 每次跑本地 dev 都会变，一改就触发 Go 全量重编译）。
# 注意只排数据库文件本身：db/migrations/*.sql 是仓库资源，必须保留。
app/server/db/*.db
app/server/db/*.db-shm
app/server/db/*.db-wal
app/server/uploads
app/server/tmp

# Agent / 本地工作产物（非源码，仅在开发机上存在）
agent_briefs
artifacts
.superpowers
.workbuddy
.worktrees

# Environment
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Docs (保留README)
*.md
!README.md

# IDE
.idea
.vscode
*.swp
*.swo

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
